{"sections":[{"slug":"陈特征","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"陈特征"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">陈特征</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“陈特征”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">陈特征是一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/示性类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">示性类</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它定义了环同态</span> $K(X)\\to \\prod_k H^k(X;\\mathbb Q)$. <span lang=\"zh\">它将丛的直和对应到上同调的和</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">将丛的张量积对应到上同调的积</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对向量丛</span> $E\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">任取其上的联络</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $R^E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率形式</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}(E) = \\big[ \\operatorname{tr} \\exp \\big(\\frac{i}{2\\pi}R^E\\big)\\big]\\in H^{\\text{even}}(X,\\mathbb{R}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于线丛</span> $\\xi$, $\\operatorname{ch}(\\xi)=e^{c_1(\\xi)}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $c_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">为第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于秩为</span> $r$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部自由层</span> $E$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span></p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">概形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于光滑拟射影概形</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">的有界复形</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $K_0(X)$, <span lang=\"zh\">陈特征是</span> $K_0(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/周环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">周环</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的函子性的同态</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}\\colon K_0(X)\\to A(X,\\mathbb Q).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>Todd <span lang=\"zh\">类</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Chern+character\" title=\"nLab [https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Chern+character]\">nLab</a></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $V\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是紧拓扑空间上的复向量丛</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/Todd类","text":"Todd <span lang=\"zh\">类</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Td}(V)\\in H^{\\text{ev}}(X,\\mathbb Q)$</p>\n"}]}}}]}